WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:12.145 line:0%
WELCOME BACK, HUGE CROWDS OF

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:15.248 line:0%
MIGRANTS AT THE, BORDER BETWEEN

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:16.349 line:0%
BELARUS, AND POLAND, GONE, NOW

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:16.750 line:0%
MOVED TO A GIANT WAREHOUSE

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.285 line:0%
NEARBY.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:21.154 line:0%
BUT, THE CRISIS, FAR FROM OVER.

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:24.157 line:0%
BELARUS, FLYING HUNDREDS OF

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:25.392 line:0%
PEOPLE BACK TO IRAQ, BUT OTHER

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:26.359 line:0%
MARGARINES, STILL, HOPING FOR

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:28.461 line:0%
REFUGE IN GERMANY.

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:30.330 line:0%
WITH LEADERS BLAMING BELARUS

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:32.332 line:0%
FOR ORCHESTRATING THE CRISIS,

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:34.100 line:0%
IN RETALIATION, FOR SANCTIONS

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:34.567 line:0%
PUT ON THE LUKASHENKO

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.503 line:0%
GOVERNMENT.

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:37.504 line:0%
THE BELARUSIAN FOREIGN MINISTER,

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:39.472 line:0%
HE SAYS THAT IS A LIE.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:43.243 line:0%
HE, SPOKE EXCLUSIVELY, WITH

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:46.112 line:0%
CNN'S MATTHEW CHANCE.

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:48.615 line:0%
&gt;&gt; AT THE AIRPORT, IN MINSK,

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.149 line:0%
THE FIRST REPATRIATION FLIGHT

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:52.452 line:0%
WAITS TO BOARD.

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:54.654 line:0%
THE PASSENGERS, MOSTLY, IRAQI

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:55.055 line:0%
KURDS, DID NOT MAKE IT TO

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:55.855 line:0%
EUROPE.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:56.456 line:0%
BUT AT LEAST, THEIR BELL ROOFS

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:57.323 line:0%
ORDEAL IS AT AN END.

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:57.724 line:0%
THIS IS THE NIGHTMARE THEY LEFT

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:03.029 line:0%
BEHIND.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:03.730 line:0%
OFFICIALS CONFIRMED, THIS

00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:04.364 line:0%
FOREST CAMP, ON THE POLISH

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:04.998 line:0%
BORDER, NOW, IS EMPTY.

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:06.366 line:0%
THE SHOCKING IMAGES OF

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:08.401 line:0%
DESPERATE MIGRANTS, LANGUISHING

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:10.904 line:0%
IN THE COLD, HAVE LEFT A MARK.

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:12.238 line:0%
NOW, FOR THE FIRST TIME, CNN IS

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:13.239 line:0%
ABLE TO HOLD A SENIOR,

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:13.640 line:0%
BELARUSIAN OFFICIAL, TO

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:16.142 line:0%
ACCOUNT.

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:17.811 line:0%
&gt;&gt; TO SEE HOW THEY SUFFER, IT'S

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:18.278 line:0%
VERY DIFFICULT FOR A NORMAL

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:20.947 line:0%
HUMAN BEING.

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:22.348 line:0%
WE ARE NOT INTERESTED IN HAVING

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:22.749 line:0%
THE SITUATION, HERE, AND

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:25.051 line:0%
DOLORES.

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:26.419 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU SAY YOU DON'T WANT TO

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:27.921 line:0%
SEE THE SCENES, BUT YOU ARE

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:29.355 line:0%
ACCUSED, OR BELARUS IS ACCUSED,

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.756 line:0%
OF ORCHESTRATING THIS ENTIRE

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:32.559 line:0%
CRISIS.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:34.394 line:0%
OF ENCOURAGING MIGRANTS TO COME

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:34.994 line:0%
HERE, AND OF DIRECTING THEM

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:36.129 line:0%
TOWARDS THAT BORDER.

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:38.531 line:0%
YOU CREATED THE SCENES.

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:39.265 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YES, WE HAVE HAD A LOT OF

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:40.733 line:0%
ACCUSATIONS TOWARDS BELARUS.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:43.103 line:0%
THIS IS A FALSE ASSESSMENT.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:44.504 line:0%
&gt;&gt; ALSO FALSE, ACCORDING TO THE

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:45.805 line:0%
FOREIGN MINISTER, U.S., AND

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:47.440 line:0%
EUROPEAN ALLEGATIONS, THAT

00:01:45.972 --> 00:01:48.942 line:0%
RUSSIA, WHICH RECENTLY FLEW THE

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:50.510 line:0%
STRATEGIC BOMBER FLIGHTS, OVER

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:52.378 line:0%
BELARUS, AND SUPPORT, REALLY,

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:54.714 line:0%
IS BEHIND THE CRISIS,

00:01:52.545 --> 00:01:55.281 line:0%
ENCOURAGING ITS ALLY TO

00:01:54.881 --> 00:02:02.822 line:0%
DISTRACT THE WEST.

00:01:56.349 --> 00:02:03.456 line:0%
WHILE PREPARING MILITARY PLANS

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:12.665 line:0%
ELSEWHERE IN UKRAINE.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:16.503 line:0%
&gt;&gt; AS WE GOT TO THIS MIGRANT

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:20.106 line:0%
CRISIS, I CAN, DEFINITELY, SAY

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:20.507 line:0%
THAT RUSSIA HAS NOTHING TO DO

00:02:20.273 --> 00:02:26.379 line:0%
WITH IT.

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:29.315 line:0%
&gt;&gt; BUT, IT WAS PRESIDENT PUTIN,

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:32.886 line:0%
HE TELLS, ME WHO SORT OF

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:35.822 line:0%
TELEPHONE CALLS BETWEEN THE

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:36.256 line:0%
GERMAN, AND BELARUSIAN LEADERS,

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:38.558 line:0%
THIS WEEK.

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:41.427 line:0%
HOPING TO DEFUSE THE CRISIS.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:45.865 line:0%
&gt;&gt; AND, IT NEEDED TO FUSING.

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:48.635 line:0%
THIS IS THE SCENE WHEN ANGRY

00:02:46.032 --> 00:02:51.538 line:0%
MIGRANTS TRIED TO FORCE THEIR

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:52.038 line:0%
WAY INTO EUROPE, PAST POLISH

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:56.743 line:0%
BORDER GUARDS.

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:58.378 line:0%
THE REFUSAL OF BELARUS TO

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:59.145 line:0%
INTERVENE, FUELING RUMORS THAT

00:02:58.545 --> 00:03:02.849 line:0%
THEY ENCOURAGED THESE ATTACKS.

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:05.084 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THE EUROPEAN UNION SAYS,

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:07.387 line:0%
BELARUS HAS CREATED THIS CRISIS,

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:09.956 line:0%
TO PUNISH THEM, IN REVENGE FOR

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:11.624 line:0%
THE SANCTIONS THAT THE EU HAS

00:03:10.123 --> 00:03:13.326 line:0%
IMPOSED AGAINST BELARUS, FOR

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:13.793 line:0%
ITS CRACKDOWN ON THE

00:03:13.493 --> 00:03:20.400 line:0%
OPPOSITION.

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:20.867 line:0%
HOW DO YOU ANSWER THAT

00:03:20.567 --> 00:03:21.701 line:0%
ALLEGATION?

00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:22.335 line:0%
THERE &gt;&gt; IT IS A LIE.

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:23.069 line:0%
IT'S AN ABSOLUTE LIE.

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:23.870 line:0%
BELARUS HAS SHOWN THAT THAT

00:03:23.236 --> 00:03:24.637 line:0%
SIDE OF THE EUROPEAN DEMOCRACY.

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:25.338 line:0%
AND, YOU HAVE SEEN, YOURSELF,

00:03:24.804 --> 00:03:26.806 line:0%
WHAT WAS HAPPENING, AT THE

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:27.173 line:0%
BORDER WITHIN THE LAST 2, OR 3,

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:30.076 line:0%
DAYS.

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:30.677 line:0%
&gt;&gt; IT HAS SHOWN THE STRENGTH OF

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:34.047 line:0%
EUROPEAN UNITY, TO.

00:03:32.178 --> 00:03:35.715 line:0%
THE NOW REMAINING MIGRANTS, IN

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:37.450 line:0%
BELARUS, ARE BEING HOUSED IN

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:39.285 line:0%
THIS GIANT, HEATED WAREHOUSE.

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:43.189 line:0%
BACK FROM THE VOLATILE BORDER.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:44.691 line:0%
BUT, WITH EUROPE, REFUSING TO

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:46.759 line:0%
BACK DOWN, IT IS BELARUS THAT

00:03:44.857 --> 00:03:47.193 line:0%
MUST, NOW, KEEP THEM, OR SOME

00:03:46.926 --> 00:03:48.661 line:0%
THEM HOME.

00:03:47.994 --> 00:03:48.928 line:0%
MATTHEW CHANCE, CNN, MINSK.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:51.764 line:0%
MATTHEW CHANCE, CNN, MINSK.

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:05.044 line:0%
CNN INTERNATIONAL DIPLOMATIC

00:04:03.343 --> 00:04:06.112 line:0%
EDITOR, NIC ROBINSON, JOINS, ME

00:04:05.211 --> 00:04:09.249 line:0%
LIVE, IN LONDON.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.250 line:0%
REPATRIATION TO IRAQ UNDERWAY,

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:11.918 line:0%
GERMANY SAYS IT WON'T BE

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:13.152 line:0%
BULLIED INTO TAKING THOSE WHO

00:04:12.085 --> 00:04:14.320 line:0%
REMAIN IN BELARUS.

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:18.124 line:0%
WHAT HAPPENS TO THEM?

00:04:14.721 --> 00:04:20.960 line:0%
WHAT IS NEXT ON ALL OF THIS?

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:23.096 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT'S ONE PART OF AN

00:04:21.127 --> 00:04:27.133 line:0%
ONGOING SAGA, BETWEEN

00:04:23.263 --> 00:04:27.500 line:0%
BELARUSSIA, AND THE EUROPEAN

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.301 line:0%
UNION.

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:29.936 line:0%
WHAT HAPPENED TO THOSE MIGRANTS,

00:04:28.468 --> 00:04:31.904 line:0%
CAUGHT UP IN THIS MOMENT, THE

00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:33.940 line:0%
INDICATIONS ARE, A, ROCK AT,

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:35.141 line:0%
LEAST IS OFFERING TO TAKE BACK

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:35.508 line:0%
ALL OF THOSE WHO WANT TO COME

00:04:35.308 --> 00:04:37.143 line:0%
BACK.

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:38.911 line:0%
THE POLISH PRIME MINISTER SPOKE

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.979 line:0%
WITH THE IRAQI PRIME MINISTER,

00:04:39.078 --> 00:04:40.713 line:0%
AND VOWED, HE WOULD DO

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:41.514 line:0%
EVERYTHING HE COULD TO HELP

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.148 line:0%
THOSE PEOPLE GET BACK, WHO WANT

00:04:41.848 --> 00:04:44.217 line:0%
TO GET BACK.

00:04:42.849 --> 00:04:47.120 line:0%
BUT, INEVITABLY, THERE WILL BE

00:04:44.384 --> 00:04:50.123 line:0%
PEOPLE WHO WANT TO STAY, AND IT

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:53.126 line:0%
IS SOMETHING TO COME BACK TO.

00:04:50.857 --> 00:04:54.927 line:0%
IT IS SOMETHING SPENT WITH

00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:56.296 line:0%
THEIR LAST REMAINING MONEY TO

00:04:55.094 --> 00:04:58.131 line:0%
GET BACK TO BELARUSSIA, BECAUSE

00:04:56.863 --> 00:04:59.098 line:0%
IT IS SO CLOSE TO EUROPE.

00:04:58.298 --> 00:05:00.066 line:0%
THEREFORE, THEY WERE NOT

00:04:59.265 --> 00:05:02.201 line:0%
PREPARED TO GIVE UP.

00:05:00.233 --> 00:05:04.337 line:0%
AT THE MOMENT, IT SEEMS THAT

00:05:02.368 --> 00:05:05.938 line:0%
IT'S THEIR RESPONSIBILITY FOR

00:05:04.504 --> 00:05:07.240 line:0%
THEM, AND HOW TO MANAGE IT, AND

00:05:06.105 --> 00:05:08.908 line:0%
WILL LAND WITH THE GOVERNMENT

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.009 line:0%
IN MINSK, WITH ALEXANDER

00:05:09.075 --> 00:05:13.046 line:0%
LUKASHENKO.

00:05:10.843 --> 00:05:14.247 line:0%
I THINK THE INDICATIONS ARE

00:05:13.212 --> 00:05:17.083 line:0%
TOUTED BY THE BELARUSIAN SIDE,

00:05:14.714 --> 00:05:19.085 line:0%
AND THE IDEA THAT GERMANY WOULD

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:21.254 line:0%
TAKE SO MANY THOUSAND, AND

00:05:19.252 --> 00:05:21.721 line:0%
BELARUSSIA WOULD SEND THE

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:25.058 line:0%
OTHERS BACK.

00:05:21.888 --> 00:05:28.328 line:0%
WHAT AWAITS THEM IS A, VERY,

00:05:25.224 --> 00:05:31.397 line:0%
VERY, DIFFICULT SITUATION.

00:05:29.929 --> 00:05:34.167 line:0%
AND, POTENTIALLY, BEING TOLD

00:05:31.564 --> 00:05:36.936 line:0%
THAT YOU MUST LEAVE.

00:05:34.834 --> 00:05:37.337 line:0%
IT IS UP IN THE AIR AT THE

00:05:37.103 --> 00:05:39.906 line:0%
MOMENT.

00:05:37.837 --> 00:05:41.908 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I'M CURIOUS, HAS THIS

00:05:40.073 --> 00:05:44.944 line:0%
EXPOSED FAILING, IN THE EU'S

00:05:42.075 --> 00:05:45.445 line:0%
OWN MIGRANT POLICIES, PUSHING

00:05:45.111 --> 00:05:47.914 line:0%
MIGRANTS BACK?

00:05:46.679 --> 00:05:51.918 line:0%
THAT, FOR EXAMPLE, IS BEING

00:05:48.081 --> 00:05:52.518 line:0%
CRITICIZED TO CONTRARY TO

00:05:52.085 --> 00:05:55.922 line:0%
HUMANITARIAN NORMS.

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:56.289 line:0%
IT IS BEING EXPOSED IN SOME

00:05:56.089 --> 00:05:59.926 line:0%
WAYS.

00:05:56.889 --> 00:06:01.094 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THERE ARE ARGUMENTS FOR THE

00:06:00.093 --> 00:06:03.896 line:0%
EUROPEAN UNION, WITH THE

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:05.164 line:0%
EFFORTS OF LUKASHENKO, AND THEY

00:06:04.063 --> 00:06:07.166 line:0%
DON'T FOLLOW DEMOCRATIC

00:06:05.331 --> 00:06:09.268 line:0%
POLICIES WHO, HAD AN ELECTION,

00:06:07.333 --> 00:06:11.037 line:0%
LAST YEAR, BY ALL ACCOUNTS, ONE

00:06:09.836 --> 00:06:11.537 line:0%
AT FRAUDULENTLY, ALTHOUGH HE

00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:13.072 line:0%
WOULD DENY IT.

00:06:11.838 --> 00:06:17.944 line:0%
IT DID NOT RECOGNIZE AS A

00:06:13.239 --> 00:06:18.478 line:0%
LEGITIMATE PRESIDENT WITH THE

00:06:18.111 --> 00:06:22.382 line:0%
EUROPEAN UNION.

00:06:18.845 --> 00:06:23.216 line:0%
IT WAS, AS THE EUROPEANS SAY,

00:06:22.548 --> 00:06:25.184 line:0%
IT IS MANIPULATION.

00:06:23.383 --> 00:06:28.988 line:0%
IT WAS AN ABNORMAL SITUATION,

00:06:25.351 --> 00:06:30.923 line:0%
AND YOU HAVE AN AUTOCRAT WHO

00:06:29.155 --> 00:06:31.891 line:0%
HAS A GOOD VALUES OF

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:35.928 line:0%
DEMOCRACIES, WHICH IS HELPING

00:06:32.058 --> 00:06:37.330 line:0%
PEOPLE, AND TRYING TO SHOW, IN

00:06:36.095 --> 00:06:38.898 line:0%
FACT, WHAT HAPPENED, IS THAT

00:06:37.663 --> 00:06:40.166 line:0%
THE EUROPEAN UNION ISN'T

00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:41.901 line:0%
HOLDING UP ITS OWN VALUES.

00:06:40.333 --> 00:06:42.902 line:0%
I THINK YOU HEARD IT WITH THEIR,

00:06:42.068 --> 00:06:43.403 line:0%
AND WITH THE FOREIGN MINISTER

00:06:43.069 --> 00:06:46.906 line:0%
SAID AS WELL.

00:06:44.637 --> 00:06:47.907 line:0%
SO, THIS IS A POSITION THAT,

00:06:47.073 --> 00:06:49.008 line:0%
DEMOCRACIES, AROUND THE WORLD,

00:06:48.074 --> 00:06:50.910 line:0%
FIND THEMSELVES THEM.

00:06:49.175 --> 00:06:51.377 line:0%
UNDER PRESSURE FROM

00:06:51.077 --> 00:06:53.112 line:0%
AUTOCRACIES.

00:06:51.677 --> 00:06:54.213 line:0%
THOSE POLITICAL GAIN, AT HOME,

00:06:53.679 --> 00:06:57.083 line:0%
FOR LUKASHENKO.

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:58.918 line:0%
IF HE CAN PULL OFF THIS

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:59.485 line:0%
MANIPULATION OF THE SITUATION,

00:06:59.085 --> 00:07:01.954 line:0%
THAT IS HAPPENING.

00:06:59.852 --> 00:07:02.889 line:0%
BUT, FUNDAMENTALLY, WITH THE

00:07:02.121 --> 00:07:04.924 line:0%
EUROPEAN UNION, POLITICAL

00:07:03.055 --> 00:07:06.926 line:0%
LEADERS ARE SAYING, SIMPLY, IS

00:07:05.091 --> 00:07:07.360 line:0%
THAT THIS IS NOT A NORMAL

00:07:07.093 --> 00:07:10.263 line:0%
SITUATION.

00:07:08.661 --> 00:07:12.198 line:0%
THESE ARE NOT NORMAL MIGRANTS,

00:07:10.663 --> 00:07:13.232 line:0%
WHO HAPPEN TO HAVE ARRIVED AT

00:07:12.365 --> 00:07:14.967 line:0%
THE BORDER, AND ARE STILL

00:07:13.399 --> 00:07:15.368 line:0%
TRYING TO CLAIM POLITICAL

00:07:15.134 --> 00:07:17.236 line:0%
ASYLUM.

00:07:15.668 --> 00:07:19.939 line:0%
THIS HAS BEEN A MANIPULATION,

00:07:17.403 --> 00:07:22.909 line:0%
FROM ALLOWING SO MANY MIGRANTS

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.376 line:0%
TO GET VISAS, TO GET INTO

00:07:23.075 --> 00:07:26.112 line:0%
BELARUSSIA.

00:07:24.644 --> 00:07:26.579 line:0%
AND THEN, HELPING THEM GET TO

00:07:26.279 --> 00:07:28.347 line:0%
THE BORDER.

00:07:26.746 --> 00:07:30.183 line:0%
FUELING THE NOTION, THEY MAY BE

00:07:28.514 --> 00:07:33.019 line:0%
ABLE TO CROSS THE BORDER.

00:07:30.349 --> 00:07:36.889 line:0%
HELPING THEM OUT, TO A DEGREE.

00:07:33.186 --> 00:07:39.058 line:0%
GIVEN THESE MIGRANTS, AND

00:07:37.056 --> 00:07:41.928 line:0%
PERMISSION TO DO THINGS, AND

00:07:39.225 --> 00:07:42.628 line:0%
WITH THE RUSSIAN CITIZENS,

00:07:42.094 --> 00:07:42.995 line:0%
BELARUSIAN CITIZENS, DON'T

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:44.330 line:0%
HAVE.

00:07:43.663 --> 00:07:45.064 line:0%
THAT IS A FRUSTRATION NEAR

00:07:44.497 --> 00:07:46.365 line:0%
OPINION HAS.

00:07:45.231 --> 00:07:48.167 line:0%
FOR THAT REASON, THEY SAY, THIS

00:07:46.532 --> 00:07:51.137 line:0%
IS NOT A NORMAL SITUATION.

00:07:48.668 --> 00:07:54.140 line:0%
THAT PUTS THEM IN THIS POSITION

00:07:51.871 --> 00:07:54.140 line:0%
OF HAVING AN AUTOCRATIC TO

